# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Flow: Kargath (where forever/horde/30-40/06-badlands ends) -> fly to Booty Bay (the Snapjaw
# skins, Hostile Takeover and Sunken Treasure; Kebok's tusks and Crank Fizzlebub's crystals taken
# for the north) -> fly to Grom'gol -> Nesingwary's camp -> north through Duskwood and Deadwind
# Pass -> the Swamp of Sorrows' 35-43 quests (the Harborage, Stonard, Galen, Noboru, Misty Reed
# Post) -> fly to Grom'gol -> Zul'Kunda -> the Bubbling Cauldron -> the jungle stalkers -> the
# Venture Co. mine -> Zul'Mamwe and Balia'mah -> Nesingwary -> Grom'gol, where the next guide
# takes the zeppelin to Orgrimmar.
#
# The Swamp of Sorrows comes first: its quests (35-43) are the lowest of the band and the
# route reaches Kargath at about 38-40. Stranglethorn's 44-46 quests in the south (the
# Bloodsail, Mistvale, Zanzil, Mok'thardin's last two parts, Speaking with Gan'zulah and
# Yenniku) wait for the second visit at 45 (forever/horde/40-50/03-stranglethorn-vale).
#
# Carried to the second visit: Skullsplitter Tusks (209) and Venture Company Mining (600),
# finished here, handed in at Booty Bay at 45. Grim Message (2932) goes to the Hinterlands.

step Fly to Booty Bay
  zone Badlands
  goto 4.1,44.9 "Kargath flight master"
  fly "Booty Bay"
  zone Stranglethorn Vale

step Booty Bay
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  turnin 577                          -- Drizzlik: the Snapjaw skins gathered earlier; inside
  tip Gringer, the flight master, waits on Booty Bay's upper deck. The quest givers stand on the boardwalks around the harbour and in the inn.
  accept 209                            -- Kebok, upstairs
  turnin 213                          -- Kebok
  accept 2872                           -- for Stoley in Tanaris; on the top floor
  turnin 669
  accept 600                            -- Crank Fizzlebub
  accept 2864                           -- Krazek: for Tran'rek in Gadgetzan; upstairs
  vendor nearest

step Fly to Grom'gol
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  goto 26.8,77.0 "Booty Bay flight master"
  fly "Grom'gol"

step Grom'gol Base Camp
  turnin 1240                           -- Kin'weelay
  accept 598                            -- Kin'weelay
  accept 2932                           -- Nimboya: for the Hinterlands, around level 48

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nesingwary

step Nesingwary's camp
  turnin 195                          -- Hemet Nesingwary
  tip Head north up the road; the hunters camp on the hill above the river.
  accept 196                            -- Hemet Nesingwary
  turnin 192                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  turnin 339 optional                 -- Barnil Stonepot
  turnin 340 optional
  turnin 341 optional
  turnin 342 optional
  turnin 338 optional

step Nesingwary's camp
  when group 193
  accept 193

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North to the Swamp of Sorrows

step Duskwood
  zone Duskwood
  goto 87.8,35.6 "Duskwood"

step Deathstalker Zraedus
  accept 1372
  turnin 1372

step Swamp of Sorrows
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  goto 26.0,31.4 "Swamp of Sorrows"

step Into the Swamp of Sorrows
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Keep going north into Duskwood, then east along the road through Deadwind Pass into the swamp. Magtoor waits at the Harborage, the draenei camp near the way in from Deadwind Pass.
  accept 1389                           -- Magtoor

step Stonard
  tip Head east to Stonard, in the reeds south of the road.
  accept 698                            -- Dar, inside

step Stonard
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Bind here: from Misty Reed Post on the coast you hearth back to Stonard for the flight to Grom'gol.
  getfp "Stonard" npc 6026              -- Breyk
  turnin 1420                           -- Helgrum the Swift, upstairs
  sethome "Stonard" npc 6930            -- Innkeeper Karakul, upstairs
  accept 1424                           -- Fel'zerul, on the top floor

step Sawtooth crocolisks
  tip The crocolisks wallow in the pools around Galen's camp and south towards Stonard; about one in four drops a flank.
  tip Careful: Tok'Kar's camp sits by the coast. Along the way to it you pass level 40 spiders that chase a long distance, plus stealthed Shadow Panthers.
  collect 6169 quest 698.1

step Noboru the Cudgel
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Noboru wanders the clearing south-west of the Fallow Sanctuary; his cudgel starts a quest.
  kill 5477 @54.9,34.1
  collect 6196 "Noboru's Cudgel"
  accept 1392

step Draenethyst crystals
  tip Head north-east to the Fallow Sanctuary. The crystals stand along the way up to Galen Goodward's cage.
  collect 6071 x6 quest 1389.1          -- Draenethyst Crystals

step Galen's Escape
  tip Galen Goodward is held in the Fallow Sanctuary in the swamp's north-east. Free him and follow him out, fighting off the swamp creatures that chase him.
  accept 1393
  complete 1393

step The Harborage
  tip Follow the road west to the draenei camp at the Harborage, near the way in from Deadwind Pass.
  turnin 1392 optional -- Magtoor
  turnin 1389

step Galen's Strongbox
  tip His strongbox waits at his old camp north of Stonard.
  turnin 1393

step Misty Reed Post
  tip Head back east past Stonard and follow the road south-east to the small Horde post on the shore.
  turnin 698                            -- Tok'Kar
  accept 699

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back to Stranglethorn

step Fly to Grom'gol
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  goto 46.1,54.7 "Stonard flight master"
  fly "Grom'gol"
  zone Stranglethorn Vale

step Zul'Kunda
  tip North of Grom'gol, past the expedition's hill, the Bloodscalp chiefs Gan'zulah and Nezzliok stand together in the ruins of Zul'Kunda. Clear their guards first, then pull them.
  collect 3904 quest 584.1
  collect 3905 quest 584.2

step Grom'gol
  turnin 584                            -- the Bubbling Cauldron, beside Nimboya
  accept 585

step Jungle stalkers
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The Jungle Stalkers hunt the jungle south of Grom'gol, out to the west coast. Kill them for Nesingwary and take their feathers for Mok'thardin.
  collect 3863 quest 572
  kill 687 quest 196.1

step Far Seer Mok'thardin
  turnin 572

step Venture Co. mine
  tip East of Grom'gol, the goblins of the Venture Co. dig at the mine east of the road; miners, foremen, surveyors and tinkerers all drop the crystals.
  collect 3917 quest 600.1

step Zul'Mamwe
  tip Head north to the Skullsplitter ruins east of the Venture Co. mine; pull the headhunters and berserkers one at a time. One pile of trophy skulls stands on the ruins' north side. Every Skullsplitter can drop a tusk or a necklace: the necklaces are the slow part, so keep killing in the warriors' camp north of the ruins until you have them all.
  goto 45.4,36.2 "Skullsplitter warriors"
  collect 1524 quest 209.1
  collect 3908 quest 585.3

step Balia'mah Ruins: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip The next trophy skulls stand in the small ruins just north of the warriors' camp.
  tip The last skulls are in the ruins a short walk west, on the way back to Grom'gol.
  collect 3916 quest 598.1
  collect 3906 quest 585.1
  collect 3907 quest 585.2

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nesingwary and Grom'gol

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  tip Head north up the road to the hunters' camp.
  turnin 196                            -- Hemet Nesingwary

step Nesingwary's Expedition
