step Raptor Mastery
  when group 197
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Tethis is a level 43 elite: most classes solo it at level 45, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 3877 quest 197.1 @31.5,41.2 map 1434

step Panther Mastery
  when group 193
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Bhag'thera is a level 40 elite: most classes solo it at level 42, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 3876 quest 193.1 @49.4,24.0 map 1434

