  level 42.68                          -- grind on Skullsplitter Warrior

step Big Game Hunter
  when group 208
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. King Bangalash is a level 43 elite: most classes solo it at level 45, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  tip Careful: Tigers and stealthed shadowmaw panthers roam close to him. Clear them before you pull him. When he is pulled, King Bangalash calls for help from creatures within 20 yd.
  collect 3880 quest 208.1 @38.2,35.6 map 1434

step Hemet Nesingwary
  when group 208
  turnin 208

step Level 42.74
