  when level<42.74
  tip If you skipped Big Game Hunter, grind here to level 42.74 to stay on the route's plan.
  goto 42.5,35.7 map 1434 "Skullsplitter Warrior"
  level 42.74                          -- grind on Skullsplitter Warrior

